# Cloudflare Pages redirects/rewrites for Trainer's Codex.
# Documented at: https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/
#
# The bundle is a single static HTML with no router, so every app "route" has to
# be rewritten to the document with a 200 (a 301/302 would change the URL and
# lose the query string the deep-link depends on).
#
# /journey is the Journey Mode entry point. It must preserve ?seed=, ?daily=,
# ?pace= and ?archetype= — those params ARE the shared journey. Cloudflare
# carries the query string through a 200 rewrite automatically.
/journey            /index.html   200
/journey/*          /index.html   200
